    {"type": "field", "disp": 16, "window": "MACEI2C", "label": "bus object +16", "binaries": ["usr/cpu/sysgen/IP32boot/mvp.o"], "functions": ["mvpi2c_fastmode", "mvpi2c_init_regs"], "loads": ["lw"], "why": "these two routines take the bus object, not the interface base; the object word at +16 is the interface base 0xbf330000, which both chip objects hold (docs/mace-video.md, Driver access)"},
