    {"type": "chain", "label": "screen private record", "array_disp": 436, "index_disp": -28072, "loads": ["lw"], "fields": [{"disp": 0, "window": "RE", "offset": 0, "label": "private +0x0"}, {"disp": 8, "window": "GBE", "offset": 0, "label": "private +0x8"}], "binaries": ["usr/lib/X11/dyDDX/crm.so"], "why": "the module reads the screen's private array at +0x1b4, adds the slot named by crmScreenPrivateIndex (0x5aa0f8, gp-28072) scaled by 4, loads the private record from slot word 0, and takes the rendering-engine mapping from private +0x0 and the GBE mapping from private +0x8 (docs/xmodule.md, The pointer chain)"}
